  "content": "\n\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全新重构的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面优化，支持光影</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自定义&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影预设</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 新增首领与生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; Foes</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 数百个全新地下城与建筑（</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager Structures</a></span><strong>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5>✔️ 生活便利功能，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Storage</a></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️</strong> **包含 1.21.2+ 内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a>&nbsp;附带&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">额外功能</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 众多自定义功能，带来更佳体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 内置 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费世界分享</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f57903%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">330+ 模组</a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/71yfq8avpc4\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEDj3QS45X4\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aJSOHjG6Jew\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或微软批准或认可。</strong></span></h5>",
